            "action_description": {
              "value": "Uri makes two Strikes: one with his scimitar and one with his shield spikes. If both hit, the overwhelming power of the attack leaves the target stunned 1 (stunned 2 if one of the Strikes was a critical hit, or stunned 3 if both Strikes were critical hits). These Strikes count as one attack for Uri's multiple attack penalty, and the penalty doesn't increase until after both attacks."
